      "text": "people of Lehi1 driven before wind toward promised land, 1 Ne. 18:8. converts shall not be driven with fierce winds whithersoever enemy listeth to carry them, Alma 26:6. Satan to sift transgressor as chaff before wind, Alma 37:15 (Morm. 5:18). devil’s winds have no power over those built upon rock of the Redeemer, Hel. 5:12 (3 Ne. 14:24–25; Matt. 7:24–25). gates of hell stand open to receive those built on sandy foundation when winds beat upon them, 3 Ne. 11:40 (14:26–27; 18:13; Matt. 7:26–27). those built on rock do not fall when winds blow, 3 Ne. 14:25. Nephites are driven as chaff before wind, Morm. 5:16, 18. winds have gone forth out of the Lord’s mouth, Ether 2:24. furious wind blows Jaredite vessels toward promised land, Ether 6:5–8.",
